      "title": "Nvidia scandal: Howard Lutnick under pressure over alleged lack of action",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/13/nvidia-scandal-sparks-us-national-security-concerns-china",
      "description": "<p>US commerce secretary faces sack as warnings emerge about alleged Chinese spy’s ties to Jensen Huang and delays in adding Megaspeed to trade blacklist</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/13/us-politics-latest-news-updates-democrats-republicans-donald-trump-van-hollen-chuck-schumer\">US politics – live updates </a></p></li></ul><p>The US commerce secretary, Howard Lutnick, is facing growing pressure over his apparent lack of action over the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/nvidia\">Nvidia spying scandal</a> as other Trump administration officials publicly raise questions over his decisions.</p><p>Jensen Huang <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/12/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resigns\">resigned from Nvidia</a> on Thursday, and was replaced on an interim basis by the company’s chief financial officer, <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/12/jensen-huang-nvidia-ceo-replacement\">Colette Kress</a>, after reports emerged of his multiple affairs, most importantly with Alice Huang (no relation), who is suspected of being a Chinese spy.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/13/nvidia-scandal-sparks-us-national-security-concerns-china\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-13T09:41:22"
    },
    {
      "title": "Former NSW Liberal MP Rory Amon found guilty of raping 13-year-old boy",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/13/former-nsw-liberal-mp-rory-amon-found-guilty-of-raping-13-year-old-boy",
      "description": "<p>The 37-year-old was convicted in the state’s supreme court months after a different jury failed to reach a verdict on the same charges</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A former NSW Liberal politician is facing the possibility of a significant jail term after a jury found him guilty of raping a 13-year-old boy.</p><p>The former MP Rory Amon was found guilty by a jury, after about four hours of deliberation on Friday, of one count of sexual intercourse with a person aged between 10 and 14 and indecently assaulting a child.</p><p><em>Support for anyone affected by the subject matter of this report is available at Full Stop Australia (1800 385 578).</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/13/former-nsw-liberal-mp-rory-amon-found-guilty-of-raping-13-year-old-boy\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-13T10:45:48"
    },
