      "description": "<p>Treasury secretary says he was in favor ‘for months’ of putting Megaspeed on blacklist to stop Nvidia exporting advanced chips to Beijing</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/13/nvidia-scandal-sparks-us-national-security-concerns-china\">Howard Lutnick under pressure over alleged lack of Nvidia action</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>In other tech-related news, the Microsoft outage is still going. </strong>The longest in the company’s history. My colleagues are covering the latest and how it’s affecting millions and pretty much every industry …</p><p>As I noted earlier, the calls for Howard Lutnick to appear before lawmakers on Capitol Hill have been answered.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/13/us-politics-latest-news-updates-democrats-republicans-donald-trump-van-hollen-chuck-schumer\">Continue reading...</a>",
